{"id":"W34e1a2e629c954416d366559","zh":"随机不平顺","en":"","name":"随机不平顺","language":"zh","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","families":[],"definition_zh":"作为随机过程或随机场描述的轨道几何偏差。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"通常作为车辆—轨道系统的随机几何激励，用于分析轮轨相互作用及动力响应的概率特征，也可与横风、车轮磨耗或扣件失效共同考虑。参数比较与优化分析中可采用相同不平顺样本，以比较不同参数组合下的响应。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W34e1a2e629c954416d366559","text":"随机不平顺","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sca9cf9149921bdfeccfe","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"视横风和轨道随机不平顺激扰下的车辆-轨道系统为随机非线性系统。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sb37563cfeadb90c94743","source_id":"P111","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"(4)将得到的复序列X(k)进行IFFT可获得轨道随机不平顺模拟信号。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S3ac8fe3f6e50a264ea9d","source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"在上述系统分层设计的基础上,可采用如下步骤进行系统参数的匹配设计: (1)运用车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型,针对不同的系统设计层,变化设计层中所属参数的幅值范围,假定其他设计层的参数不变,输入一条确定性的随机不平顺样本,进行不同参数组合下的动力响应计算。","citations":[{"source_id":"P117","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S58f6f756d43bba1a66f9","source_id":"P118","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"对于一条特定的干线铁路,通过轨检车定期检测轨道随机不平顺的累积数据是十分巨大的。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Sf4edb0911bb09ee2bfbd","source_id":"P118","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"从计算结果可知: (1)考察车轮磨耗的动力影响时,建议考虑轨道随机不平顺的联合作用。","citations":[{"source_id":"P118","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"S2abf3fe5c63028d31170","source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型 [24],可以开展轨道随机不平顺作用下的动力极值计算;而轨道不平顺概率模型能遍历随机不平顺不同类型间的幅值-波长组合,其给出的概率信息能用于可靠度分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"Sa5d8f8d984eafe48cb87","source_id":"P131","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"轨道随机不平顺作为车辆-轨道系统中极为重要的激振源,准确把握其概率分布特性是进行车辆-轨道系统可靠度计算的前提。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"Sc1d2e0c98609477c8e4c","source_id":"P137","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"使用隔振元件时,钢轨和浮置板位移有超限风险,因此, 选定车体垂向最大加速度、钢轨垂向最大位移、 浮置板垂向最大位移和隧道壁最大Z振级这4个核心指标(分别用J1、J2、J3、J4代指上述指标)作为综合评估的依据,在相同随机不平顺激励下,对不同参数组合工况下的动力响应进行计算和分析, 工况设计见表1。","citations":[{"source_id":"P137","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P001":{"id":"P001","title":"A new model for temporal–spatial stochastic analysis of vehicle–track coupled systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2016.1270456","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (3), 427-448","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-temporal-spatial-stochastic-analysis"},"P005":{"id":"P005","title":"Extended applications of track irregularity probabilistic model and vehicle–slab track coupled model on dynamics of railway systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2017.1319961","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (11), 1686-1706","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-extended-probabilistic-track-applications"},"P007":{"id":"P007","title":"On effects of track random irregularities on random vibrations of vehicle–track interactions","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao, M Meacci, X Chen","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.probengmech.2017.10.002","journal_citation":"Probabilistic Engineering Mechanics 50, 25-35","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-track-irregularity-random-vibrations"},"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"},"P117":{"id":"P117","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2019","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2019.05.022","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system"},"P118":{"id":"P118","title":"车轮踏面磨耗及轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2020","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2020.02.011","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-stochastic-analysis-model-for-vehicle-track-coupled-systems-under-joint-random-irregularities-of-whe"},"P131":{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"},"P137":{"id":"P137","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","authors":"陈宪麦,黄厚龙,徐磊,胡逸宁,仵雷振,邓燚","year":"2025","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2025.01.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"陈宪麦等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[{"id":"W0b390be60b54ddc4030f41a4","target_concept_id":"W0b390be60b54ddc4030f41a4","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":null,"label":"上位概念","reason":"随机过程或随机场描述是轨道不平顺的特定表征，保留随机限定。；关系类型描述目标角色：目标为上位概念。"}],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"以固定样本输入模型，激励不同参数组合的动力响应。","language":"zh","source_id":"P117","paper_slug":"2019-multi-layer-design-and-weight-method-for-parameter-optimization-of-vehicle-track-system","title":"用于车辆-轨道系统参数优化的分层设计与权重组合方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"激发车辆与轨道振动的几何扰动，各参数工况采用相同激励进行比较。","language":"zh","source_id":"P137","paper_slug":"2025-analysis-of-multi-parameter-influence-and-matching-in-floating-plate-system-considering-weight-coeff","title":"考虑权重系数的浮置板系统多参数影响与匹配分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W0d864a7addbeef9a9303ad55","name":"track random irregularity","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason"